      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a formal letter to my landlord in berlin? my radiator in the living room stopped working and it's getting really cold. i need to tell the Hausverwaltung that it needs fixing asap. it should sound professional and serious so they actually do something about it.",
