      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can help you draft a formal letter to your landlord in Berlin. You can start by addressing the issue in a clear and concise manner, using a tone that's both professional and assertive. Here's a sample letter:\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Address]\n[City, Postcode]\n[Date]\n\nHausverwaltung [Landlord's Name]\n[Landlord's Address]\n[City, Postcode]\n\nDear [Landlord's Name],\n\nI am writing to bring to your attention a pressing issue with the heating system in my living room. Unfortunately, the radiator has ceased to function, resulting in a significant drop in temperature. As you can imagine, this is causing discomfort and inconvenience for me, and I kindly request that you arrange for its immediate repair.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could dispatch a maintenance technician to inspect and rectify the issue as soon as possible. I have been a responsible tenant, always paying my rent on time and maintaining a clean and tidy living space. I believe it is only fair that I receive a functional heating system, especially during the colder months.\n\nI would like to request a timeline for the repair and an estimated completion date, so I can plan accordingly. I am confident that with your prompt attention",
